Z||000002||ChadMan||08-15-2001||09:28 AM||||Those films are fantastic, aren't they?  Every single one.  For action, my favorite would have to be the first one (the Frankenheimer one), but for the story, I thought "The Follow" was great.<P>Most modern advertising sucks.  But these films are different...they're creative and entertaining, and they're effective!  I'd be happy as hell with any of the new BMW's (except the X5).  Of course, I'd have to keep my Fiero for old time's sake...||||reg||14
