Z||000004||artherd||08-16-2001||04:03 AM||||These film/ads are a stroke of genius.<P>Give a few $mil to a director and say "make anything, just have a BMW chase scene in it".<P>Positions BMW as an ultra-cool company in a very classy, very understated, very effective way.<P>I totally want an M5 now.<P>My fave is either Star of The Follow.<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
